- 3cec75e (2026-10-06, main head checked 2026-10-07): compositor
  translation polling compares the last committed frame, including idle
  frames, rather than the deliberately retained last encode; hidden glass
  settles while application frames continue. Skip the shared shadow pass
  when no contributor has shadows. Fake shapes with appearance overrides
  get their own backdrop transfer, including when the shared transfer is
