  frost seed, census and tuned blur sigmas remain. Fused outlines exclude
  separately served shapes using nested inverse clips (no Path.combine).
  Morph layer builders set their surface palette explicitly; containers
  use Morph brightness so compatible surfaces retain a shared transfer.

